    # allowance: peak_cached stays 175 MiB under coverage at 320) and the
    # initramfs in tmpfs (38 MiB plain, 54 under `bazel coverage`, whose
    # instrumented binaries are larger: peak_shmem 48 and 67 MiB) left a
    # coverage guest of 216 MiB with the cache at 175 MiB (plain: 157) at the
    # peak, close enough to kswapd's watermark that one CI run on btrfs had
